    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537297/pharmacy-coordinator-at-the-rank-of-dispenser-ii-technical-officer": {
      "title": "Pharmacy Coordinator (at the rank of Dispenser II/ Technical Officer)",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Executive / Technical / Support 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Pharmacy Coordinator (at the rank of Dispenser II/ Technical Officer) The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537297 Work type: Full-time Department: Clinical Trials Centre (21180) Categories: Executive / Technical / Support Hong Kong Pharmacy Coordinator (at the rank of Dispenser II/ Technical Officer) in the Clinical Trials Centre (Ref.: 537297) The Clinical Trials Centre (HKU-CTC) is a leading clinical trials management platform established under The University of Hong Kong LKS Faculty of Medicine (HKUMed) and is dedicated to managing and facilitating international-standard clinical trials on new drugs, medical devices and medical technologies. HKU-CTC offers long-term development opportunities to passionate talents who are devoted to a career in the clinical trial profession. HKU-CTC’s Research Pharmaceutical Core (PharmCore) is a core facility located at the Queen Mary Hospital, which is dedicated to managing, storing and processing pharmaceuticals for clinical trials use. PharmCore is seeking talents who have the passion for promoting healthcare advancement through practising the pharmacy profession in the clinical research domain.  Comprehensive on-the-job training will be provided. Main Responsibilities: Assist in performing drug management responsibilities for clinical trials, including receipt, storage, handling, reconstitution, dispensing and disposal of research drugs; and Assist in maintaining documentation for inventory and accountability management. Occasional work outside normal business days or hours may be required. Requirements: Higher Diploma in Dispensing Studies or equivalent; or a Bachelor’s degree or above in Pharmacy; Good time management skills; Responsible and self-motivated; and A strong team player with the ability to work under pressure. Those with lower qualifications or less experience may be considered for appointment as Dispenser II. Shortlisted candidates will be invited to attend an interview. Those who have responded to the previous advertisement (Ref.: 536937) need not re-apply. The appointment will commence as soon as possible on a 1-year temporary basis or 2-year fixed terms basis, with the possibility of renewal subject to satisfactory performance. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. Appointment on 2-year fixed term basis will attract a contract-end gratuity and University contribution to a retirement benefits scheme, totalling up to 10% of basic salary. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online at the University's careers site ( https://jobs.hku.hk ) and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start from September 26, 2026, 2026 and continue until October 11, 2026 or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 12, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Oct 11, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537297 Pharmacy Coordinator (at the rank of Dispenser II/ Technical Officer) Clinical Trials Centre (21180) Oct 11, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537297 Pharmacy Coordinator (at the rank of Dispenser II/ Technical Officer) Clinical Trials Centre (21180) Oct 11, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
